This project is a fork of, and builds on, "fable5-opus5-orchestrator"
by Yusuf Demirkoparan (https://github.com/Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator),
licensed under the MIT License. The fork point is upstream v0.23.0
(commit 1a503b9, 2026-09-07), the last release that shipped tier
routing, the playbook and the fresh-eyes verifier; upstream later
narrowed itself to a clarify-only plugin (v0.24–0.25), and this
project continues the full orchestration design instead.

Retained from upstream, largely verbatim: the clarify gate and its
markdown parser, the ledger gates, the Stop-hook cadence and
ownership logic, the session markers, tmux teammate reaping, the
SessionStart profile-switch delta logic, and the test harness.

Added in this project: the tier map and routing table (config/), the
route guard, the verify valve, seven tiered agent definitions, six
slash commands, the standalone skill, the doctor, and their tests.

The full git history of the upstream work is preserved in this
repository so that authorship is visible commit by commit.
